Subject: [PATCH 039/230] Keep SQLite on a persistent disk and snapshot it
 nightly
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Render wipes the filesystem without a disk, so every deploy was resetting
the database; the blueprint now mounts /var/data and pins one instance.
A nightly in-process job reuses the backup script (a cron job cannot mount
the service's disk), and the backup CLI now loads .env.

